- Speakers
- Headphones
- FP Headphones
that have mutual exclusion, so that when you are using one of them, you c=
annot use the others. Sometimes the Speakers output disappears from alsam=
ixer.
   =20
By restarting the computer, the system gets back to its normal behaviour.=


